item.description:
This week we discuss;
00:00:51 - Panasonic drop kick plasma 00:05:17 - Samsung curved OLED Review 00:06:13 - Panasonic WT600 4K & LG 4K TV Reviews 00:09:24 - Pioneer come back to the TV market, but no Kuro plasma 00:13:02 - Even more 4K news 00:20:23 - Will Microsoft sell off the games division? and is next Gen really next Gen? 00:30:50 - Tech News - Curved iPhone 6? 00:33:34 - The Hong Kong smart watch? 00:36:04 - Movie and TV news - Are Netflix and BT Sport changing the pay TV models? 00:54:18 - What's at the cinema Steve? This week it's Gravity 00:59:03 - Goodbyes
Presented by Steve Withers with Mark Hodgkinson, Ed Selley & Mark Botwright.

